WEBVTT

00:00:03.186 --> 00:00:07.085
Open Interaction Center, Management, Lead Sources.

00:00:07.085 --> 00:00:14.536
The starter recipe added Web form, Referral, Trade show, Purchased list, Advertisement and Cold call.

00:00:14.989 --> 00:00:18.081
A lead source is an ordinary content item.

00:00:18.081 --> 00:00:22.332
Click New to add one, such as Partner event, and publish it.

00:00:22.332 --> 00:00:28.839
It then appears in the lead source pickers of leads, opportunities, activity loads and imports.

